    "detailed_description": "Lost Plane: Survival is an intense open-world survival adventure where you find yourself stranded on a mysterious, uncharted island after a devastating plane crash. With no signs of rescue, your only goal is to survive.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGather resources, craft tools, and build a secure base to protect yourself from the island\u2019s deadly inhabitants, and other lurking dangers. Manage your hunger and thirst by hunting, foraging, and purifying water, all while exploring the island.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Hunger &amp; Thirst: You must hunt animals, fish, or forage for berries and edible plants. Freshwater sources must be boiled or purified before drinking.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Base Building: Chop trees to build walls, roofs, and defenses to protect yourself from animal attacks at night.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Traps &amp; Defenses: Set up spike traps, snares, or wooden barricades to fend off wolves and other threats.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Tools &amp; Weapons: Craft spears, bows, and stone axes for hunting and self-defense.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Boars: Territorial and aggressive if provoked, capable of destroying weak structures.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Birds: Can be hunted for food but require traps or patience.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Day/Night Cycle: Nights are dangerous, with more predators becoming active and visibility decreasing.",
